<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Configurações - Meu Divulga Ninja</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #0d1117; color: #c9d1d9; font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif; }
        .sidebar { height: 100vh; background-color: #010409; color: white; padding-top: 20px; border-right: 1px solid #30363d;}
        .sidebar .nav-link { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: 500;}
        .sidebar .nav-link.active, .sidebar .nav-link:hover { color: white; background-color: #21262d; border-radius: 5px; }
        .main-content { padding: 40px; }
        /* Style dos Cards de Loja */
        .store-card { background-color: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; padding: 25px 20px; transition: transform 0.2s;}
        .store-card:hover { border-color: #8b949e; }
        .store-logo { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 10px; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 15px; background: white; padding: 5px;}
        .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 600;}
        .status-pendente { background-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.15); color: #d29922; border: 1px solid rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.4);}
        .status-pronto { background-color: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.15); color: #2ea043; border: 1px solid rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.4);}
        .btn-config { background-color: #21262d; border: 1px solid #30363d; color: #c9d1d9; width: 100%; font-weight: 600; padding: 8px;}
        .btn-config:hover { background-color: #30363d; color: white;}
        /* Modais */
        .modal-content { background-color: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; color: #c9d1d9;}
        .modal-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; }
        .modal-footer { border-top: 1px solid #30363d; }
        .form-control { background-color: #010409; border: 1px solid #30363d; color: white; }
        .form-control:focus { background-color: #010409; color: white; border-color: #58a6ff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.25);}
        .form-label { font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; }
        .text-muted { color: #8b949e !important; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="row">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <nav class="col-md-3 col-lg-2 d-md-block sidebar collapse">
            <div class="position-sticky">
                <h4 class="text-center mb-4 text-white fw-bold">
                    <i class="bi bi-robot text-primary"></i> MeuDivulga
                </h4>
                <ul class="nav flex-column gap-1">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#"><i class="bi bi-speedometer2 me-2"></i> Dashboard</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i> Gerar Promoção</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/settings"><i class="bi bi-globe me-2"></i> Minhas Afiliações</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item mt-4 border-top border-secondary pt-2"><a class="nav-link text-danger" href="/logout"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i> Sair do Painel</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="col-md-9 ms-sm-auto col-lg-10 main-content">
            <div class="mb-5">
                <h2 class="fw-bold text-white">Minhas Afiliações</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Conecte suas plataformas e em seguida vá em "Gerar Promoção" para automatizar seus links.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Alertas -->
            <% if (success) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-success bg-success bg-opacity-10 border-success text-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill me-2"></i> <%= success %>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <!-- Grid de Placaformas -->
            <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-4 g-4">
                
                <!-- AliExpress -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card">
                        <img src="https://logospng.org/download/aliexpress/logo-aliexpress-icon-1024.png" class="store-logo" alt="AliExpress">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">AliExpress</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">5 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.aliAffiliateTemplate || (settings.aliApiKey && settings.aliApiSecret && settings.aliTrackingId)) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalAli"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Amazon -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card">
                        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Amazon_icon.png" class="store-logo" alt="Amazon">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">Amazon</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">1 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.amazonTag) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalAmazon"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Mercado Livre -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card">
                        <img src="https://http2.mlstatic.com/frontend-assets/ml-web-navigation/ui-navigation/5.21.22/mercadolibre/logo__small@2x.png" class="store-logo bg-warning" alt="Mercado Livre">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">Mercado Livre</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">1 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.mlAffiliateLink) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalML"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Shopee -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card">
                        <img src="https://logospng.org/download/shopee/logo-shopee-icon-1024.png" class="store-logo" alt="Shopee">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">Shopee</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">4 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.shopeeAffiliateTemplate || (settings.shopeeAppKey && settings.shopeeAppSecret)) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalShopee"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- KaBuM! -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card" style="border-bottom: 3px solid #0b2ea1;">
                        <div class="store-logo d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="background:#0b2ea1; color:#fff; font-weight:800; font-size:20px;">KB</div>
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">KaBuM!</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">2 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.kabumAffiliateTemplate) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalKabum"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Magalu -->
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="store-card" style="border-bottom: 3px solid #0086ff;">
                        <img src="https://logodownload.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/magalu-logo-0.png" class="store-logo bg-white" alt="Magalu">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white">Magalu</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-2">1 campo(s) configuráveis</div>
                        <% if(settings.magaluAffiliateLink) { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pronto">Pronto</div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="status-badge status-pendente">Pendente</div>
                        <% } %>
                        <button class="btn btn-config" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalMagalu"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i> Configurar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= MODALS ================= -->

<!-- Modal Amazon -->
<div class="modal fade" id="modalAmazon" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <form action="/settings" method="POST">
          <div class="modal-header">
            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">Configurar Amazon</h5>
            <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
          </div>
          <div class="modal-body">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Partner Tag (ID de Associado)</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="amazonTag" value="<%= settings.amazonTag %>" placeholder="Ex: seunome-20">
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Link ou modelo de afiliado</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="amazonAffiliateTemplate" value="<%= settings.amazonAffiliateTemplate %>" placeholder="Opcional: deeplink com {url}">
                <div class="text-muted small mt-2">
                    Com <code>{url}</code> no meio, o endereço do produto entra no lugar (deeplink de rede de afiliados).
                    Sem <code>{url}</code>, o link salvo substitui o do produto. Em branco, publica o link original da loja.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Parâmetros extras (opcional)</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="amazonAffiliateParams" value="<%= settings.amazonAffiliateParams %>" placeholder="Ex: sub_id=grupo-whatsapp">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="modal-footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Gravar Depois</button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Salvar Chave</button>
          </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal AliExpress -->
<div class="modal fade" id="modalAli" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <form action="/settings" method="POST">
          <div class="modal-header">
            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">Configurar AliExpress</h5>
            <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
          </div>
          <div class="modal-body">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">API Key</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="aliApiKey" value="<%= settings.aliApiKey %>">
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">API Secret</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="aliApiSecret" value="<%= settings.aliApiSecret %>">
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Tracking ID</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="aliTrackingId" value="<%= settings.aliTrackingId %>">
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Link ou modelo de afiliado</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="aliAffiliateTemplate" value="<%= settings.aliAffiliateTemplate %>" placeholder="Ex: https://s.click.aliexpress.com/deep_link.htm?dl_target_url={url}">
                <div class="text-muted small mt-2">
                    Com <code>{url}</code> no meio, o endereço do produto entra no lugar (deeplink de rede de afiliados).
                    Sem <code>{url}</code>, o link salvo substitui o do produto. Em branco, publica o link original da loja.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Parâmetros extras (opcional)</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="aliAffiliateParams" value="<%= settings.aliAffiliateParams %>" placeholder="Ex: sub_id=grupo-whatsapp">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="modal-footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Voltar</button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Salvar Chaves</button>
          </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

